# Everything below is produced by running this lab and must never be committed.
#
# This file is deliberately local to the workshop rather than relying on a repository-root
# ignore: you will run `terraform init` in terraform/, which downloads provider binaries
# measured in hundreds of megabytes, and `pytest`, which leaves bytecode caches. A copy of
# this directory taken into another repository loses any root-level rule but keeps this one.
#
# .terraform.lock.hcl is NOT ignored on purpose: it pins provider versions so every
# participant resolves the same ones.
.terraform/
terraform.tfstate
terraform.tfstate.*
terraform.tfvars
*.tfplan

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# Benchmark output: your own measurements, not repository content.
bench/results/
